  "body": "The three large reference artifacts in `examples/` were still v2.3-labelled. Aligned to the current system:\n\n- **`Mantle_MacroDroid_Schema.yaml`** \u2014 full update of the `mantle_alignment` contract: framework \u2192 Gen-4, FIELD_GUIDE + MOLT_LEDGER added to the audit bundle, genesis key named, `cognition_gating` rewritten as nociception, and a new `gen4_capabilities` block. The MacroDroid JSON schema body is host-specific and untouched. *(embedded YAML still parses)*\n- **`Mantle_Spreadsheet_Agent.html`** / **`Mantle_Reference_Agent.html`** \u2014 relabel `v2.3` \u2192 `Gen-4` consistently (the spreadsheet's framework declaration + its self-audit check stay matched; the reference agent's `GENESIS_VERSION` bumped symmetrically), and enrich the ontology/system prompts with the Gen-4 organ hardening (self/other key, event-gated nociception, graded memory) + a pointer to the reproductive/symbiotic tissue in the `mantle/` package. *(structure verified: balanced tags, valid string concat)*\n- **`examples/README.md`** \u2014 reclassify the three from \"legacy\" to Gen-4-aligned reference demos, honest about scope: the in-browser HTML demos run the **inherited Body/organ/VCW core** (unchanged in Gen-4) and do **not** reimplement the new tissue in JS.\n\nExamples only \u2014 the `mantle/` package and the gate are untouched (66/66 still green).\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
